{"slug":"/students/subjects/physics/mechanics/linear-motion/","source":"students/subjects/physics/mechanics/linear-motion.html","area":"students","kind":"content","title":"Linear Motion | Physics Mechanics","description":"","subject":"physics","body":"<div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto\">\n        <nav class=\"mb-8\">\n            <a href=\"/students/subjects/physics/mechanics/\" class=\"text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700\">← Back to Mechanics</a>\n        </nav>\n\n        <div class=\"content-card rounded-xl p-8\">\n            <header class=\"mb-12\">\n                <h1 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Linear Motion</h1>\n                <p class=\"text-lg text-gray-600\">Understanding motion in a straight line through displacement, velocity, and acceleration</p>\n            </header>\n\n            <div class=\"grid gap-8\">\n                <!-- Basic Concepts -->\n                <section>\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Basic Concepts</h2>\n                    <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6\">\n                        <!-- Position and Distance -->\n                        <div class=\"bg-white/50 rounded-lg p-6\">\n                            <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3\">Position &amp; Distance</h3>\n                            <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-700\">\n                                <li>• Position: Location relative to reference point</li>\n                                <li>• Distance: Length of actual path taken</li>\n                                <li>• Distance is scalar (magnitude only)</li>\n                                <li>• Position is a vector quantity</li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Displacement -->\n                        <div class=\"bg-white/50 rounded-lg p-6\">\n                            <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3\">Displacement</h3>\n                            <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-700\">\n                                <li>• Vector quantity (has direction)</li>\n                                <li>• Change in position</li>\n                                <li>• Straight line from start to end</li>\n                                <li>• Can be positive or negative</li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Reference Frame -->\n                        <div class=\"bg-white/50 rounded-lg p-6\">\n                            <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3\">Reference Frame</h3>\n                            <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-700\">\n                                <li>• Origin point (0 position)</li>\n                                <li>• Direction convention (+/-)</li>\n                                <li>• Choice of coordinates</li>\n                                <li>• Motion is relative</li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n\n                <!-- Velocity -->\n                <section>\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Velocity</h2>\n                    <div class=\"space-y-6\">\n                        <!-- Types of Velocity -->\n                        <div class=\"bg-white/50 rounded-lg p-6\">\n                            <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\">\n                                <div>\n                                    <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3\">Average Velocity</h3>\n                                    <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-700\">\n                                        <li>• Total displacement ÷ total time</li>\n                                        <li>• v̄ = Δx/Δt</li>\n                                        <li>• Vector quantity</li>\n                                        <li>• Units: m/s (SI)</li>\n                                    </ul>\n                                </div>\n                                <div>\n                                    <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3\">Instantaneous Velocity</h3>\n                                    <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-700\">\n                                        <li>• Velocity at specific instant</li>\n                                        <li>• v = lim[Δt→0](Δx/Δt)</li>\n                                        <li>• Tangent to position curve</li>\n                                        <li>• Speed = |velocity|</li>\n                                    </ul>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Speed -->\n                        <div class=\"bg-white/50 rounded-lg p-6\">\n                            <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3\">Speed vs Velocity</h3>\n                            <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\">\n                                <div>\n                                    <h4 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">Speed</h4>\n                                    <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-700\">\n                                        <li>• Scalar quantity</li>\n                                        <li>• Total distance ÷ time</li>\n                                        <li>• Always positive</li>\n                                        <li>• No direction specified</li>\n                                    </ul>\n                                </div>\n                                <div>\n                                    <h4 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">Velocity</h4>\n                                    <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-700\">\n                                        <li>• Vector quantity</li>\n                                        <li>• Displacement ÷ time</li>\n                                        <li>• Can be positive/negative</li>\n                                        <li>• Direction specified</li>\n                                    </ul>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n\n                <!-- Acceleration -->\n                <section>\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Acceleration</h2>\n                    <div class=\"space-y-6\">\n                        <!-- Types of Acceleration -->\n                        <div class=\"bg-white/50 rounded-lg p-6\">\n                            <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\">\n                                <div>\n                                    <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3\">Average Acceleration</h3>\n                                    <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-700\">\n                                        <li>• Change in velocity ÷ time taken</li>\n                                        <li>• ā = Δv/Δt</li>\n                                        <li>• Vector quantity</li>\n                                        <li>• Units: m/s² (SI)</li>\n                                    </ul>\n                                </div>\n                                <div>\n                                    <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3\">Instantaneous Acceleration</h3>\n                                    <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-700\">\n                                        <li>• Rate of change of velocity</li>\n                                        <li>• a = dv/dt</li>\n                                        <li>• Tangent to velocity curve</li>\n                                        <li>• Direction can vary</li>\n                                    </ul>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Sign Conventions -->\n                        <div class=\"bg-white/50 rounded-lg p-6\">\n                            <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3\">Sign Conventions</h3>\n                            <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\">\n                                <div>\n                                    <h4 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">Positive Acceleration</h4>\n                                    <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-700\">\n                                        <li>• Speed increasing in +ve direction</li>\n                                        <li>• Speed decreasing in -ve direction</li>\n                                    </ul>\n                                </div>\n                                <div>\n                                    <h4 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">Negative Acceleration</h4>\n                                    <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-700\">\n                                        <li>• Speed decreasing in +ve direction</li>\n                                        <li>• Speed increasing in -ve direction</li>\n                                    </ul>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n\n                <!-- Graphical Analysis -->\n                <section>\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Graphical Analysis</h2>\n                    <div class=\"bg-white/50 rounded-lg p-6\">\n                        <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6\">\n                            <div>\n                                <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3\">Position-Time Graph</h3>\n                                <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-700\">\n                                    <li>• Slope = velocity</li>\n                                    <li>• Curved = changing velocity</li>\n                                    <li>• Straight = constant velocity</li>\n                                    <li>• Horizontal = stationary</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </div>\n                            <div>\n                                <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3\">Velocity-Time Graph</h3>\n                                <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-700\">\n                                    <li>• Slope = acceleration</li>\n                                    <li>• Area = displacement</li>\n                                    <li>• Straight = constant acceleration</li>\n                                    <li>• Horizontal = constant velocity</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </div>\n                            <div>\n                                <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3\">Acceleration-Time Graph</h3>\n                                <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-700\">\n                                    <li>• Area = change in velocity</li>\n                                    <li>• Horizontal = constant acceleration</li>\n                                    <li>• Zero line = no acceleration</li>\n                                    <li>• Sign shows direction</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n\n                <!-- Practice Problems -->\n                <section>\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Practice Problems</h2>\n                    <div class=\"bg-white/50 rounded-lg p-6\">\n                        <ol class=\"list-decimal pl-6 space-y-4 text-gray-700\">\n                            <li>\n                                <p class=\"font-medium mb-2\">Distance vs Displacement</p>\n                                <p>A student walks 40 meters east, then 30 meters west. Calculate:</p>\n                                <ul class=\"list-disc pl-6 mt-2 space-y-1 text-sm\">\n                                    <li>Total distance traveled</li>\n                                    <li>Net displacement</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </li>\n                            <li>\n                                <p class=\"font-medium mb-2\">Average Velocity</p>\n                                <p>A car travels 150 meters east in 10 seconds, then 60 meters west in 5 seconds. Find:</p>\n                                <ul class=\"list-disc pl-6 mt-2 space-y-1 text-sm\">\n                                    <li>Average velocity for each segment</li>\n                                    <li>Overall average velocity</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </li>\n                            <li>\n                                <p class=\"font-medium mb-2\">Acceleration</p>\n                                <p>A car accelerates from rest to 20 m/s in 5 seconds. Calculate:</p>\n                                <ul class=\"list-disc pl-6 mt-2 space-y-1 text-sm\">\n                                    <li>Average acceleration</li>\n                                    <li>Distance traveled (assuming constant acceleration)</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </li>\n                        </ol>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n<!-- Topic Quiz System -->","bodyClass":"min-h-screen bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-50 to-indigo-100 p-6","bodyStyle":"","css":["body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; }\n        .content-card {\n            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);\n            backdrop-filter: blur(16px);\n            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);\n            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);\n            box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);\n        }"],"quiz":null,"tracker":null,"links":[]}